hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2176","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nek aadmi ka achha khwaab nabuwwat key chhiyalees hisson mein se hissa hai. (Bukhari: 6983)"
"2177","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab tum mein se koi khwaab dekhey jo use pasand ho to wo Allah se hai. To use Allah ki hamd karni chaahiye aur usey bayan karna chaahiye. Aur jab uskey siwa dekhey jo wo naapasand karta hai to wo shaitaan se hai. To use uski buraai se panaah maangni chaahiye aur use kisi ko na bataana chaahiye. Beshak wo use nuqsaan na dega. (Bukhari: 6985)"
"2178","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Nabuwwat mein khushkhabriyon key siwa baaqi nahi raha. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur khushkhabriyaan kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Nek khwaab. (Bukhari: 6990)"
"2179","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo mujhey khwaab mein dekhey wo mujhey jaagtey mein dekhega. Aur shaitaan meri soorat nahi bana sakta. (Bukhari: 6993)"
"2180","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo mujhey dekhey us ne haq dekha. Beshak shaitaan meri soorat nahi bana sakta. (Bukhari: 6997)"
"2181","[AI-translation] Maalik key betey Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Milhaan ki beti Umm Haraam key paas daakhil hotey they. Jabke wo Saamit key betey Ubaada key nikaah mein theen. To Aap aik din unkey paas daakhil huey aur unhon-ne Aap ko khilaaya aur Aap key sar mein juen dekhney lagein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) soey. Phir jaagey jabke Aap hans rahey they. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Tumhey kya hansaata hai Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se log mujh par pesh kiye gaey jo Allah key raastey mein ladney waley hain. Wo is samandar ki peeth par sawaar hain, takhton par baadshah, ya takhton par baadshahon jaisey. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Allah se dua kijiye ke wo mujhey un mein banaaye! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unkey liye dua ki. Phir Aap ne apna sar rakkha. Phir jaagey jabke Aap hans rahey they. To main ne kaha: Tumhey kya hansaata hai Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se log mujh par pesh kiye gaey jo Allah key raastey mein ladney waley hain. Jaisa pehli mein farmaya tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Allah se dua kijiye ke wo mujhey un mein banaaye! Aap ne farmaya: Tum pehlon mein ho. To wo Muawiya bin Abi Sufyan key zamaaney mein samandar mein sawaar huin aur apni sawaari se giren jab samandar se niklein. Aur halaak huin. (Bukhari: 7002)"
"2182","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab zamaana qareeb ho to momin ka khwaab taqreeban jhoot na hoga. Aur momin ka khwaab nabuwwat key chhiyalees hisson mein se hissa hai. Aur jo nabuwwat mein se tha beshak wo jhoot nahi bolta. (Bukhari: 7017)"
"2183","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne dekha goya kaali bikhrey baalon wali aurat Madina se nikli yahan tak ke Mahyaa mein khadi hui, aur wo Juhfa hai. To main ne taabeer kya ke Madina ki waba uski taraf muntaqil hui hai. (Bukhari: 7038). Musa se, mera khayaal hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Main ne apne khwaab mein dekha ke main ne talwaar hilaai aur uska seena toot gaya. Phir wo tha jo mominon ko Uhad key din pahuncha. Phir main ne use doosri martaba hilaaya aur wo waisa ho gaya jaisa tha. Phir wo tha jo Allah Uhad key din laaya, fatah aur mominon key jama honay key sath. (7041). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"2184","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo khwaab ghaday jo us ne nahi dekha use takleef di jaaeygi ke wo jau key do daanon key darmiyaan girah lagaaey aur wo kabhi na karega. Aur jo qaum ki baat suney jabke wo us se nafrat kartay hon uskey kaan mein Qiyaamat key din seesha daala jaaeyga. Aur jo tasweer banaaey use azaab diya jaaeyga aur use takleef di jaaeygi ke wo us mein phoonkey jabke wo phoonkney wala nahi hai. (Bukhari: 7042)"
"2185","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak badey jhooton mein se hai ke wo apni aankhon ko dikhaaey jo unhon-ne nahi dekha. (Bukhari: 7043)"
"2186","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) bayan kartey they ke aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Beshak main ne aaj raat khwaab mein saaybaan dekha jo ghee aur shehed tapkaata hai. To main logon ko dekhta hun ke wo us mein se letey hain. To zyada lenay wala aur kam lenay wala. Phir rassi jo zameen se aasmaan tak mili hui hai. To main tumhey dekhta hun ke tum ne use pakda aur buland huey. Phir usey doosrey aadmi ne pakda aur uskey sath buland hua. Phir usey doosrey aadmi ne pakda aur uskey sath buland hua. Phir usey doosrey aadmi ne pakda aur wo toot gaya. Phir joda gaya. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Merey maan baap tum par qurbaan! Allah ki qasam tum mujhey chhorogey aur main uski taabeer karunga. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Taabeer karo! Us ne kaha: Lekin saaybaan to Islam hai. Aur jo shehed aur ghee mein se tapakta hai to Quran, uski meethaas tapakti hai. To Quran mein zyada lenay wala aur kam lenay wala. Aur rassi jo aasmaan se zameen tak mili hui hai to haq hai jis par tum ho, tum use pakadtey ho aur Allah tumhey buland karta hai. Phir usey tumhaarey baad aadmi pakdega aur uskey sath buland hoga. Phir usey doosra aadmi pakdega aur uskey sath buland hoga. Phir usey doosra aadmi pakdega aur uskey sath toot jaaeyga, phir uskey liye joda jaaeyga aur uskey sath buland hoga. To mujhey khabar do Ya Rasulullah, merey maan baap tum par qurbaan! Kya main ne theek kya ya ghalti ki? Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne baaz theek kya aur baaz ghalti ki. Us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam Ya Rasulullah! Tum mujhey uskey sath hadees bayan karogey jismein main ne ghalti ki. Aap ne farmaya: Qasam na khaao! (Bukhari: 7046). Fitnon ki kitaab."
